      "claim": "Haloperidol, a fluorophenyl-piperidine drug, has absolute oral bioavailability of 0.70 ± 0.18 in humans, supporting high F.",
      "evidence_role": "supportive"
    },
    {
      "card_ids": ["C22"],
      "claim": "Vernakalant, a dimethoxyphenyl ether amine, has absolute oral bioavailability of 58 ± 19% in fasted healthy volunteers, supporting F ≥ 20%.",
